# Local preview (non-negotiable)

When the user asks for portfolio changes they will preview in the browser:

1. Do not mark work complete or say "refresh to see" until **http://127.0.0.1:3000/** returns success (e.g. 200).

2. Verify yourself each time: start or restart with `npm run dev:clean` from this `Portfolio` folder when the port is down or hung; poll the URL until ready (up to ~60s on cold start).

3. Do not assume an old dev server is still running.

4. If preview cannot start, state the blocker—do not claim changes are viewable.

Parent workspace also has `.cursor/rules/local-preview.mdc` (same policy).
